          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_14",
      "hash64": "F1C0A498E7E14662",
      "text": "皮卡丘的……[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_d_06_poke_03",
      "hash64": "0864DE3253BE1DB3",
      "text": "皮卡……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_15",
      "hash64": "F1C0A598E7E14815",
      "text": "……是伤心的心情！\\n这是它快哭出来时的声音呢！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_16",
      "hash64": "F1C0A298E7E142FC",
      "text": "刚才是我请皮卡丘装酷……\\n不对，是装哭了一下哦！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_17",
      "hash64": "F1C0A398E7E144AF",
      "text": "它的演技很棒对不对？\\n大家给它送上热情的掌声吧！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_d_06_popup_01",
      "hash64": "E5F5735549382D14",
      "text": "啪啪啪啪啪！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_18",
      "hash64": "F1C0A898E7E14D2E",
      "text": "讲到这里，分享一个\\n来自赛吉的贴心小建议！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_19",
      "hash64": "F1C0A998E7E14EE1",
      "text": "要是自己的宝可梦\\n发出了在伤心的声音，\\r\\n记得要温柔地对待它哦。[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_20",
      "hash64": "F1BD3A98E7DE5C6D",
      "text": "话说，这是理所当然的事！\\n对你们来说应该就是小菜一碟吧！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_21",
      "hash64": "F1BD3998E7DE5ABA",
      "text": "当然对人类而言……\\n对同班同学而言，也是一样的！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_22",
      "hash64": "F1BD3898E7DE5907",
      "text": "伤心的时候就要互相扶持！\\n赛吉老师我无论什么时候\\r\\n都想要看到你们的笑脸啊！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_23",
      "hash64": "F1BD3798E7DE5754",
      "text": "下次就是最后的课程咯，\\n到最高潮也都请多多指教！\\r\\nAdios！Bye bye！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
